    "sections": {
        "description": "A block theme for news publications and journals of record. Broadside dresses a modern WordPress site as a broadsheet newspaper: a blackletter masthead, a folio rule, a three-column lead grid, and a long-read article layout with editorial furniture — a short-answer box, key takeaways, a table of contents, an FAQ, and a sources list. Every colour, rule and section name is a Customizer setting, so one codebase can dress two mastheads without a single hard-coded brand."
    },
